{"seq":3,"slug":"approval-routing-segregation-of-duties","title":"审批路由、职责分离与审计轨迹","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/accounts-payable-invoice-automation/matching-approval/approval-routing-segregation-of-duties","wordCount":3006,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"审批路由-职责分离与审计轨迹\">审批路由、职责分离与审计轨迹</h1><p>发票从&quot;匹配通过&quot;到&quot;钱打出去&quot;，中间横着一道人和流程的控制面：谁有权批、批到什么额度、能不能批自己经手的单、批完留下什么证据。跨境电商把它放大三倍——审批人可能在另一个时区、供应商在境外、发票可能来自从没合作过的新主体，而每笔应付账款同时受总部内控、当地法定审计与境外供应商对账三方审视。本篇讲清审批链怎么按金额和风险路由、职责分离怎么落地成规则、审计轨迹要记到什么粒度，以及这些控制怎样建成可测试的组件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>匹配通过只说明&quot;数字对得上&quot;，不说明&quot;该不该付、该由谁拍板&quot;。审批层由三个互相咬合的构件组成：<strong>审批路由（approval routing）</strong> 以金额、供应商风险、采购类别、例外情况为输入，输出一条有序的审批链，回答&quot;该走几级、给谁批&quot;；<strong>职责分离（segregation of duties, SoD）</strong> 禁止同一人同时掌握授权、保管、记账三类角色，并校验审批人不是录单人、付款人不是审批人，回答&quot;这个人合不合格&quot;；<strong>审计轨迹（audit trail）</strong> 要求以不可否认的方式重建一笔付款从进入到释放的决策路径，回答&quot;能否被事后验证&quot;。三者任缺其一控制面就出现空洞——只有路由没有 SoD，等于把权力交给无人监督的节点；只有 SoD 没有审计轨迹，等于控制无法向外部证明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-谁能批-到-路由引擎\">从&quot;谁能批&quot;到&quot;路由引擎&quot;</h2><p>审批路由不是静态组织架构图，而是一台按<strong>输入特征</strong>决定<strong>下一动作</strong>的决策机。输入至少五个维度：金额（本位币折算后）、供应商风险等级、采购类别、是否命中例外（exception）、是否跨境/涉税，串起来就得到一条<strong>有序、带阈值、可并行也可否决</strong>的审批链。</p>\n<p>最小可用的路由规则可以形式化为：对发票 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>，设本位币金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，供应商风险分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{v(i)} \\in \\{0,1,2\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8943em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>（低/中/高），类别风险为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。则所需审批层级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">⌉</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_i = \\min\\Big\\{\\, L_{\\max},\\ \\big\\lceil \\log_{10}(A_i / A_0) \\big\\rceil + r_{v(i)} + c_i \\,\\Big\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">{</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">⌉</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是&quot;第一级审批即可覆盖&quot;的基准金额。含义是：金额每涨一个数量级加一级，供应商与类别风险各最多再各加一级，总层级不超过治理上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。它把&quot;金额驱动&quot;和&quot;风险驱动&quot;两条策略显式合成一条可测试的规则，而不是散落在一堆 <code>if</code> 里——跨境规则频繁变（新供应商爆雷、关税调整改变类别风险），把路由做成&quot;配置 + 引擎&quot;才能在不动代码的前提下响应。</p>\n<p>审批链的推进过程本身是一个状态机：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[发票 MATCHED&lt;br/&gt;进入审批] --&gt; B{路由引擎&lt;br/&gt;算金额+风险}&#10;  B --&gt;|金额 &lt;= A0| C[一级审批]&#10;  B --&gt;|A0 &lt; 金额 &lt;= A1| D[一级 → 二级]&#10;  B --&gt;|金额 &gt; A1| E[一级 → 二级 → 财务总监]&#10;  C --&gt; F{SoD 校验}&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt;|冲突: 审批人=录单人| G[改派 / 升级&lt;br/&gt;REASSIGN]&#10;  F --&gt;|通过| H{全部节点已批?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[下一节点]&#10;  I --&gt; F&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[APPROVED&lt;br/&gt;待付款]&#10;  G --&gt; B&#10;  J --&gt; K[付款释放&lt;br/&gt;双人复核]\">graph TD\n  A[发票 MATCHED&lt;br/&gt;进入审批] --&gt; B{路由引擎&lt;br/&gt;算金额+风险}\n  B --&gt;|金额 &lt;= A0| C[一级审批]\n  B --&gt;|A0 &lt; 金额 &lt;= A1| D[一级 → 二级]\n  B --&gt;|金额 &gt; A1| E[一级 → 二级 → 财务总监]\n  C --&gt; F{SoD 校验}\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt;|冲突: 审批人=录单人| G[改派 / 升级&lt;br/&gt;REASSIGN]\n  F --&gt;|通过| H{全部节点已批?}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[下一节点]\n  I --&gt; F\n  H --&gt;|是| J[APPROVED&lt;br/&gt;待付款]\n  G --&gt; B\n  J --&gt; K[付款释放&lt;br/&gt;双人复核]</pre><p>这两个设计点常被忽略：<strong>SoD 校验发生在每个节点而非整条链的最后</strong>——等全部批完才发现违规，前面的审批全部作废，代价极高；<code>REASSIGN</code> 回到路由引擎重算而非跳过节点，因为改派可能改变风险画像。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>金额区间（本位币）</th>\n<th>审批层级</th>\n<th>审批人角色</th>\n<th>特殊要求</th>\n<th>超时动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0 – 5,000</td>\n<td>1 级</td>\n<td>业务负责人 / 部门经理</td>\n<td>匹配自动通过可免批</td>\n<td>48h 后升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5,001 – 50,000</td>\n<td>2 级</td>\n<td>部门经理 → 财务经理</td>\n<td>跨境需附税号与贸易术语</td>\n<td>72h 后升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50,001 – 500,000</td>\n<td>3 级</td>\n<td>部门经理 → 财务经理 → 财务总监</td>\n<td>高风险供应商强制 3 级</td>\n<td>96h 后升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 500,000</td>\n<td>4 级</td>\n<td>上述 + CFO / 董事会授权</td>\n<td>需附合同与资金证明</td>\n<td>人工督办</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;超时动作&quot;是路由引擎的呼吸阀：审批卡住不是技术故障而是业务信号，必须有默认前进路径，否则整个 AP 流程会停在一张无人认领的单上——审批人休假、时差、当地节假日都会让 SLA 失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"职责分离-把-不能自己批自己-写成规则\">职责分离：把&quot;不能自己批自己&quot;写成规则</h2><p>职责分离的核心命题只有一句：<strong>授权（authorization）、保管（custody）、记录（record keeping）三类角色不能由同一个人同时承担</strong>，这是 COSO 内控框架&quot;控制活动&quot;的经典定义。套到 AP 场景就是下面这张互斥矩阵：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>建立供应商</th>\n<th>录入/提取发票</th>\n<th>匹配放行</th>\n<th>审批</th>\n<th>付款释放</th>\n<th>对账/记账</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>供应商管理员</td>\n<td>✕</td>\n<td>可</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AP 录单员</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>可</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配/例外处理</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>可</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批人</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>✕</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>可</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出纳/付款</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>可</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>财务记账</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>可</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>矩阵里最危险的三个组合，在跨境 AP 里恰恰最容易因为&quot;人手少&quot;被合并：<strong>录单 + 审批</strong>（同一人造一张发票再自己批）、<strong>建立供应商 + 付款</strong>（凭空捏造供应商并付钱给它——这正是 ACFE 报告里&quot;与供应商关系异常过密&quot;一类案件的典型路径，相关案件中位损失达 $300,000）、以及<strong>审批 + 付款释放</strong>（一人既决策又动钱）。</p>\n<p>系统怎么强制？靠<strong>角色互斥（conflicting role）规则 + 交易级校验</strong>。前者解决&quot;这个人不该同时拥有这两个权限&quot;，后者解决&quot;即使他有权限，具体到这一单也不能是自己经手的&quot;——财务总监可能兼有审批权和付款权（某些小公司允许），但规则应禁止他审批自己录单的那张发票。</p>\n<p>设发票 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的关键操作者为录单人 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^{cap}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、匹配放行人 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^{match}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1078em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、拟审批人 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^{app}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pp</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、付款人 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^{pay}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，交易级合规条件为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SoD-OK</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SoD-OK}_i \\iff u^{app}_i \\notin \\{u^{cap}_i,\\ u^{match}_i\\} \\ \\land\\ u^{pay}_i \\notin \\{u^{app}_i,\\ u^{cap}_i\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SoD-OK</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pp</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.176em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pp</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实现时有三个坑。第一，<strong>同一人可能是唯一有权限的人</strong>——小团队里&quot;唯一能批 100 万的人&quot;本身就是录单人，正确动作不是放行，而是<strong>升级到上级或引入代理</strong>。第二，<strong>代理审批（delegation）会破坏约束</strong>——A 授权 B 代批，但 B 恰好是某张单的录单人；系统必须在代理生效时重跑 SoD 校验。第三，<strong>系统账号共享</strong>会让所有校验失效——三人共用一个 <code>ap_admin</code> 账号时 SoD 在数据上无从谈起。</p>\n<p>跨境还叠加一层<strong>属地差异</strong>：某些司法辖区对电子审批的法律效力有明确要求（如需可验证的电子签名），而集团内控可能更严。落地做法是<strong>取两者并集</strong>——满足当地法定要求，同时不放松集团内控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审计轨迹-记到什么粒度才算合格\">审计轨迹：记到什么粒度才算合格</h2><p>审计轨迹（audit trail）常被误解为&quot;操作日志&quot;。区别在于：日志回答&quot;系统发生了什么&quot;，审计轨迹回答&quot;<strong>谁、在什么权限下、基于什么信息、做了什么不可否认的决定</strong>&quot;。前者是运维资产，后者是内控资产——目标不是排障，而是<strong>在事后（可能一年后、由外部审计师）能完整重建一笔付款的决策路径</strong>。</p>\n<p>一条合格的审计记录至少包含：主体（认证后的真实身份，非共享账号）、动作（审批/驳回/改派/放行）、对象（发票号 + 版本）、时间戳（含时区与可信时间源）、决策依据（审批时看到的金额、容差快照、附注）、前后状态。这正是 NIST SP 800-53 的 AU-3（审计记录内容）与 AU-9（审计信息保护）所要求的形态。粒度按&quot;能否重建决策&quot;判断，而非按记了多少行：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>必记字段</th>\n<th>不可否认要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发票进入审批</td>\n<td>发票 ID、版本、金额快照、币种、汇率与取数时点</td>\n<td>汇率来源可核（跨境必需）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批决定</td>\n<td>操作者 ID、角色、动作、时间戳、附注</td>\n<td>与录单人不同（SoD 证据）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改派/代理</td>\n<td>原审批人、新审批人、改派原因、授权依据</td>\n<td>代理链可追溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>例外放行</td>\n<td>例外类型、超差值、放行人、额外复核人</td>\n<td>超差金额与理由留痕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>付款释放</td>\n<td>释放人、付款批号、银行指令引用</td>\n<td>与审批人不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态变更</td>\n<td>前后状态、触发源（人/系统）</td>\n<td>系统动作也要有&quot;主体&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>不可否认性（non-repudiation）</strong> 是技术核心。如果&quot;张三批准了这笔付款&quot;只因张三账号处于登录态而被写入，他完全可以主张&quot;不是我点的&quot;；跨境大额付款下这直接关系责任归属与保险理赔。可行做法是关键节点要求<strong>再认证</strong>，并绑定与本次决策绑定的签名或一次性令牌，而非仅依赖会话。此外审计轨迹必须<strong>只追加（append-only）且防篡改</strong>，否则&quot;审计&quot;就退化成自我声明——常见落地是只追加的事件流配合定期哈希锚定，或把审批事件写入权限独立的存储（记账人不能改审计库），NIST 的 AU-9 讲的正是这层保护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把它建成一个可测试的组件\">把它建成一个可测试的组件</h2><p>前两节讲&quot;规则是什么&quot;，这一节讲&quot;怎么建&quot;。核心是三层分离：<strong>策略（policy）</strong> 存配置、<strong>引擎（engine）</strong> 做决策、<strong>事件（events）</strong> 做留痕。三者分开是因为变化节奏不同——策略每周可能调，引擎随业务逻辑演进，事件的 schema 要求长期稳定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"decide(invoice, context) -&gt; Decision&#10;  chain = routePolicy.resolve(invoice.amountBase, context.risk)  # 纯函数&#10;  for step in chain.steps:&#10;     if violatesSoD(assign(step), invoice) -&gt; raise Conflict&#10;  record(chain.event)        # append-only，独立于记账库&#10;  return Decision(chain)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>decide(invoice, context) -> Decision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  chain = routePolicy.resolve(invoice.amountBase, context.risk)  # 纯函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for step in chain.steps:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     if violatesSoD(assign(step), invoice) -> raise Conflict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  record(chain.event)        # append-only，独立于记账库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Decision(chain)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>record</code> 在 <code>return</code> 之前：<strong>先落事件再返回决策</strong>，否则会出现&quot;批了但无痕&quot;的空洞。三个工程要点：<code>decide</code> 必须是纯函数（同样输入永远得到同样的链，路由才可被单元测试覆盖）；事件写入与决策返回要么同一事务原子化，要么保证事件先行；日志只追加，任何修正都表达为新事件（撤销 + 重批），而非就地篡改。</p>\n<p>测试应覆盖<strong>行为</strong>而非实现：金额恰好在阈值边界（4999/5000/5001）时路由是否正确；录单人被指派为审批人时是否触发 Conflict；代理链是否被重新校验；跨时区、跨节假日时超时升级是否如期触发；以及最关键的——<strong>给定一串历史事件能否唯一重建当前审批状态</strong>。</p>\n<p>这套控制与上游匹配环节耦合：只有匹配阶段产出的例外信息（见 <a href=\"three-way-match-model\">三单匹配模型</a> 与 <a href=\"tolerance-exception-matching-rules\">容差与例外匹配规则</a>）才能让路由引擎知道&quot;这张单为什么需要额外注意&quot;。匹配回答&quot;对不对&quot;，审批路由与 SoD 回答&quot;该不该由这个人批、批了能不能查&quot;，两者合起来才是应付账款从&quot;自动&quot;走向&quot;可控&quot;的完整闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>审批路由是按输入驱动的决策机</strong>，不是静态组织图：金额定层级、风险定加成，超时必须有默认前进路径，否则跨境时差与节假日会让整条链停摆。</li>\n<li><strong>职责分离要落到&quot;交易级&quot;而非仅&quot;角色级&quot;</strong>：角色互斥挡住&quot;不该同时拥有两个权限&quot;，交易校验挡住&quot;即使有权限也不能批自己经手的单&quot;；代理审批必须在生效时重跑校验。</li>\n<li><strong>审计轨迹的目标是重建决策，不是记录日志</strong>：主体、动作、对象、依据、时间缺一不可，关键节点需再认证以保证不可否认性，审计库必须只追加、权限独立于记账库。</li>\n<li><strong>工程上拆成策略 / 引擎 / 事件三层</strong>：策略可配置、引擎是纯函数可测试、事件 schema 长期稳定；先落事件再返回决策。</li>\n<li><strong>跨境场景做&quot;并集&quot;</strong>：同时满足属地法定的电子审批效力要求与集团内控要求。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"审批路由、职责分离与审计轨迹","id":"审批路由-职责分离与审计轨迹"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从\"谁能批\"到\"路由引擎\"","id":"从-谁能批-到-路由引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"职责分离：把\"不能自己批自己\"写成规则","id":"职责分离-把-不能自己批自己-写成规则"},{"level":2,"text":"审计轨迹：记到什么粒度才算合格","id":"审计轨迹-记到什么粒度才算合格"},{"level":2,"text":"把它建成一个可测试的组件","id":"把它建成一个可测试的组件"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"容差规则与匹配置信异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/accounts-payable-invoice-automation/matching-approval/tolerance-exception-matching-rules"},"next":{"title":"付款批次与结算通道模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/accounts-payable-invoice-automation/payment-vat-crossborder/payment-run-settlement-model"}}